# - {description: 'MOSFIRE H sky continuum excess over the Gemini model, additive, in Gemini units (photons/s/arcsec^2/nm/m^2): the 10th
#     percentile per 100 A (the between-line floor) of the exposure-weighted stack of every usable frame minus the same floor of the stacked
#     Gemini model (design D61, 5.3.8; the per-frame floors and their night median are kept as excess_night_median for the D61 statistic).
#     excess is clipped at zero; excess_raw keeps the sign; excess_err is half the split-half difference. Added inside the sky_scale bracket
#     by compute.'}
# - {method: 'stack: sum over frames of exptime x columns x SB / sum of weights, per wavelength; floors = 10th percentile per 100 A bin
#     of the stacked measured and model spectra; the per-frame percentile is biased low by ~1.3 sigma at short exposures, the stack is
